          "aws_devops.handle_aws_automation_errors_with_bounded_retries_and_useful_reporting#assessment:interpret_and_bound_sdk_attempt_counts"
        ],
        "public": {
          "prompt": "Read each supplied implementation. Decide whether it meets the approved total budget of 3 requests, uses standard SDK retries without repeating the call at application level, and reports success or terminal/exhausted failure with Code, Message and optional RequestId safely. The setup/call/report helpers and imports are supplied. Every snippet is a separate implementation.",
          "buckets": [
            {
              "bucket_id": "meets",
              "label": "Meets the stated review criterion"
            },
            {
              "bucket_id": "fails",
              "label": "Does not meet the stated review criterion"
            }
          ],
          "items": [
            {
              "item_id": "i1",
              "text": "```text\nAPPROVED_ATTEMPTS = 3\nclient = supplied_client_setup(Config(retries={\"mode\": \"standard\", \"total_max_attempts\": APPROVED_ATTEMPTS}))\ntry:\n    result = supplied_ready_call(client)  # one application-level invocation\nexcept ClientError as error:\n    code = error.response[\"Error\"][\"Code\"]\n    message = error.response[\"Error\"][\"Message\"]\n    request_id = error.response.get(\"ResponseMetadata\", {}).get(\"RequestId\")\n    report_failure(code, message, request_id)\nelse:\n    report_success(result)\n# SDK handles eligible retries and backoff; terminal/exhausted errors are reported.\n```"
            },
            {
              "item_id": "i2",
              "text": "```text\nAPPROVED_ATTEMPTS = 3\nclient = supplied_client_setup(Config(retries={\"mode\": \"standard\", \"max_attempts\": APPROVED_ATTEMPTS}))\ntry:\n    result = supplied_ready_call(client)  # one application-level invocation\nexcept ClientError as error:\n    code = error.response[\"Error\"][\"Code\"]\n    message = error.response[\"Error\"][\"Message\"]\n    request_id = error.response.get(\"ResponseMetadata\", {}).get(\"RequestId\")\n    report_failure(code, message, request_id)\nelse:\n    report_success(result)\n# SDK handles eligible retries and backoff; terminal/exhausted errors are reported.\n```"
            },
            {
              "item_id": "i3",
              "text": "```text\nAPPROVED_ATTEMPTS = 3\nclient = supplied_client_setup(Config(retries={\"mode\": \"standard\", \"total_max_attempts\": APPROVED_ATTEMPTS}))\ntry:\n    result = supplied_ready_call(client)  # one application-level invocation\nexcept ClientError as error:\n    code = error.response[\"Error\"][\"Code\"]\n    message = error.response[\"Error\"][\"Message\"]\n    request_id = error.response[\"ResponseMetadata\"][\"RequestId\"]\n    report_failure(code, message, request_id)\nelse:\n    report_success(result)\n# SDK handles eligible retries and backoff; terminal/exhausted errors are reported.\n```"
            },
            {
              "item_id": "i4",
              "text": "```text\nwhile True:\n    APPROVED_ATTEMPTS = 3\n    client = supplied_client_setup(Config(retries={\"mode\": \"standard\", \"total_max_attempts\": APPROVED_ATTEMPTS}))\n    try:\n        result = supplied_ready_call(client)  # one application-level invocation\n    except ClientError as error:\n        code = error.response[\"Error\"][\"Code\"]\n        message = error.response[\"Error\"][\"Message\"]\n        request_id = error.response.get(\"ResponseMetadata\", {}).get(\"RequestId\")\n        report_failure(code, message, request_id)\n    else:\n        report_success(result)\n    # SDK handles eligible retries and backoff; terminal/exhausted errors are reported.\n```"
